  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Eastern Airspace Aviation Safety, through Boeing Company</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This Eastern Airspace Aviation Safety technical assistance grant provides for the development of a Concept of Operations (ConOps) for the Directorate General of Civil Aviation of Indonesia to help improve the safety of flight and quality of air navigation in Papua and Maluku in the eastern region of Indonesia. The intended outcome of the ConOps is to provide a recommended implementation guideline for the Papua and Maluku airspace and aviation safety program goals and objectives, required capabilities, and the changes needed to realize the Project&apos;s objectives. Over the long term the Project is designed to help increase aviation sector efficiencies, diminish operational inconsistencies in systems, reduce cost, and increase safety of the sector.</narrative>
  </description>
